msgstr "Confirmar pedidos de compra de renovación"

#. module: alfo_subscription_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:alfo_subscription_purchase.field_subscription_plan__purchase_order_auto_confirm
msgid "Confirm automatically the purchase orders generated on each renewal of the vendor subscriptions with this plan. If unchecked, they are left as requests for quotation to review."
